{"answerText":"**Do not select a DOB NOW Building Code review year from the property address alone.** The supplied enacted 2022 NYC Construction Code passages do not establish an address-to-code-year selection rule.

Noncontrolling DOB NOW user-guide context says the requested review-code selection depends on the **job type, filing date, and work type**, and that an address is used for property identification rather than determining the applicable review code. It lists 2022, 2014, 2008, 1968, and pre-1968 as possible selections. Do not infer the selection from the building’s age or apparent original construction year.

Obtain the proposed scope, job type/work type, filing date, and any related DOB/BIS job number, then verify the DOB NOW selection under the applicable DOB guidance and project filing record. No governing code-year conclusion can be made on the supplied evidence until those facts and the applicable selection authority are provided.","supportedPoints":[{"heading":"No enacted address-to-code-year rule was supplied","explanation":"The assembled current 2022 NYC enacted passages address matters such as address identification, changes to an address on a certificate of occupancy, and documentation for multiple tax lots. None establishes which DOB NOW Building Code review year must be selected from a property address alone.","sectionID":"833","sourceIDs":["research-permitext_discovered-id:833-2","research-permitext_discovered-id:9200-4","research-permitext_cross_reference-id:8950-7"]}],"assumptions":[],"missingFacts":["Proposed scope of work.","DOB NOW job type and work type.","Filing date.","Any related DOB NOW or BIS job number and its filing/approval status.","The applicable DOB authority or code-selection guidance governing the requested DOB NOW review-code selection."],"followUpQuestions":["What is the proposed work, DOB NOW job type/work type, filing date, and any related DOB NOW or BIS job number?"],"evidenceLimitations":["The supplied enacted evidence is limited to selected current 2022 NYC Construction Code passages and does not include an enacted provision establishing DOB NOW Building Code review-year selection. The DOB NOW user guide is noncontrolling administrative guidance and cannot itself establish or override an enacted code requirement."],"additionalEvidenceNeeded":["The applicable DOB NOW code-selection instructions or other controlling DOB authority, together with the filing-specific information needed to apply it."],"supportingSourceUses":[{"sourceID":"web-source-eff9cc5f5b0cfde883cce536","claimID":"web-claim-689ce41600b622b3aec730a7"},{"sourceID":"web-source-eff9cc5f5b0cfde883cce536","claimID":"web-claim-db6c4e8b44357b53d1a88e79"},{"sourceID":"web-source-eff9cc5f5b0cfde883cce536","claimID":"web-claim-d49fd3b38998c4d4e1a09623"},{"sourceID":"web-source-eff9cc5f5b0cfde883cce536","claimID":"web-claim-6226b5ffa5afbb948fd7aef2"}],"citations":[{"sectionID":"833","sourceIDs":["research-permitext_discovered-id:833-2"],"relevance":"Address-identification provision; it does not establish a DOB NOW code-review-year selection."},{"sectionID":"9200","sourceIDs":["research-permitext_discovered-id:9200-4"],"relevance":"Address-change and certificate-of-occupancy provision; it does not establish a DOB NOW code-review-year selection."},{"sectionID":"8950","sourceIDs":["research-permitext_cross_reference-id:8950-7"],"relevance":"Multiple-tax-lot construction-document provision; it does not establish a DOB NOW code-review-year selection."}]}
